<H3>HOW THIS FILE WAS MADE</H3>

<UL>
<li>Open Eva's file Akamindex.doc (dated 6 april 2004)
<li>Select everything
<li>Start "BlocNote" (NotePad)
<li>Paste, and save in UTF8 text format (NeEvaLst.utf)
<li>apply UTF_2pdy.bat and obtain a new file  (NeEvaLst.pdy)
<li>run the dos command: [find "v.r." NeEvaLst.pdy &gt; ne_vr.pdy
<li>"slightly" edit the result and make it into an hyperlinked file
<li>interprete the statistics .......... (there seems to be 215 v.r. = verbal roots)
<li>Do the same with other categories
</UL>

<HR>

